{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0316","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000031:text","row":40378,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"そうだな。","en":"Right.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905080","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00001","en":"Right, then.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000053:text","row":40379,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"一年教室に行こう。","en":"I decided to head for the first-year classroom.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905081","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00002","en":"Let's go to the First Years' classroom.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000007d:text","row":40380,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"ミキリコンビがいるかも知れない。","en":"The Miki-Kiri duo might be there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905082","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00003","en":"The Mikiri duo might just be around.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000001ff:text","row":40381,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"誰もいない。","en":"No one.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905083","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00004","en":"There is no one.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000223:text","row":40382,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"見ると、二人の机に荷物は置いてあった。","en":"But their things were on their desks.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905084","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00005","en":"Looking closer, their bags have been laid on their desks.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000261:text","row":40383,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"来てはいる。","en":"They had come to school.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905085","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00006","en":"They did come by.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000285:text","row":40384,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"校内のどこかにいるのだろうか？","en":"Were they somewhere else in the school?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905086","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00007","en":"They should be somewhere on school grounds, right?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000002bb:text","row":40385,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"考えれば、霧と美希の家の中間地点に、学校はある。","en":"Come to think of it, the school stood halfway between Miki's house and Kiri's.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905087","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00008","en":"Thinking over it, school is the midway point between Kiri and Miki's houses.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000303:text","row":40386,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"待ち合わせに、通い慣れた学校はちょうどいいのかも知れない。","en":"The school they both knew so well might have made the perfect meeting place.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905088","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00009","en":"That school they're used to go back and forth from might be just right as a meeting point, perhaps.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000355:text","row":40387,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"何をするにでもだ。","en":"No matter what they planned to do.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905089","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00010","en":"But to do what?","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese concludes that the school is convenient no matter what the pair intend to do. The English turns this into a question about their activity.","remedy":"Whatever they plan to do.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":15,"start":0,"text":"But to do what?"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000037f:text","row":40388,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"窓から外を見る。","en":"I looked out the window.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905090","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00011","en":"I look outside from the window.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000003a7:text","row":40389,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"プールが見えた。","en":"I could see the pool.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905091","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00012","en":"I could see the pool.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000004c1:text","row":40390,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「……へえ」","en":"“...Huh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905092","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00013","en":"Taichi: \"...ehhh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000004e5:text","row":40391,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"遊んでいた。","en":"They were playing in the pool.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905093","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00014","en":"They were playing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000509:text","row":40392,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"楽しげに。","en":"And having a wonderful time.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905094","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00015","en":"Cheerfully.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000052b:text","row":40393,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"かすかな声が届く。","en":"Their faint voices reached me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905095","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00016","en":"Faint voices reach me:","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000057a:text","row":40394,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「そりゃー！」","en":"“Take that!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905096","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00017","en":"Miki: \"S'oryaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000005c3:text","row":40395,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、だめだってば、だめー！」","en":"“Ah, no! Stop, stop!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00407","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00018","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00018"],"en":"Kiri: \"Ah, I said don't, dooon't!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00407","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000005c3:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000061e:text","row":40396,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「そらそらー、よけることもできないかー！」","en":"“Come on, come on! Can't even dodge?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00147","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00019","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00019"],"en":"Miki: \"Soh'ra-Soh'raaa, then you can't even avoid iiit?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00147","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000061e:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000683:text","row":40397,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「だって水の中じゃないっ、あっ、髪濡れる、濡れちゃうからっ」","en":"“But I'm not even in the water! Ah, my hair—you're getting it wet!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00849","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00020","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00020"],"en":"Kiri: \"But we're into water aren't w-, AH! You'll wet my hair, you'll get them wet!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00849","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000683:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000006fc:text","row":40398,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「どこが濡れるってーっ？」","en":"“Oh? And just what's getting wet?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00908","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00021","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00021"],"en":"Miki: \"Were am I getting you weeet?\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","typography"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00908","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000006fc:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The English uses 'Were' where the question requires 'Where.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":11,"start":7,"text":"Were"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000751:text","row":40399,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「なんかオジサンっぽい」","en":"“You sound like an old man.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01923","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00022","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00022"],"en":"Kiri: \"Why like an old lech now...\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01923","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000751:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese says the remark sounds like an older man's; the English adds lechery and an unsupported interrogative framing.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":35,"start":0,"text":"Kiri: \"Why like an old lech now...\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000007a6:text","row":40400,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「心はおじさんなの、てりゃー！」","en":"“I'm an old man at heart—hyaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00451","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00023","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00023"],"en":"Miki: \"I have the heart of an old lech, TEH'RYAAA!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["addition","register_voice"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00451","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000007a6:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese says the speaker is an older man at heart; the highlighted sexual characterization is added.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":38,"start":30,"text":"old lech"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000801:text","row":40401,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「あー、髪がー」","en":"“Ahh, my hair!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905097","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00018","en":"Kiri: \"Ah, my haaair!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000084c:text","row":40402,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「しかえしっ！」","en":"“Here’s some payback!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00302","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00025","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00025"],"en":"Kiri: \"Vengeance!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00302","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000084c:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000899:text","row":40403,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「きゃー！」","en":"“Eek!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02284","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00026","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00026"],"en":"Miki: \"Kyaaah!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02284","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000899:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000008bd:text","row":40404,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"幸せな光景を見ていた。","en":"I watched the happy scene unfold.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905098","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00019","en":"I was looking at a happy scene.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000090e:text","row":40405,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「んのー！」","en":"“Nnngh!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01887","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00028","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00028"],"en":"Kiri: \"'llyyy!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01887","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000090e:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000957:text","row":40406,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「てりゃりゃー！」","en":"“Hya-hyaah!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01968","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00029","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00029"],"en":"Miki: \"Teh'rya'ryaaa!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01968","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000957:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000009a4:text","row":40407,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「くらえー！！」","en":"“Take this!!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02227","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00030","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00030"],"en":"Kiri: \"Drink thiiis!!!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02227","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000009a4:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese battle cry means 'Take this,' not an instruction to drink.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":19,"start":7,"text":"Drink thiiis"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000009f1:text","row":40408,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「うわー……なーんて、くらわないもーん」","en":"“Waaah... psych! Missed me!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01781","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00031","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00031"],"en":"Miki: \"Waaah... buuut, I ain't gonna driiink!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","wordplay"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01781","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000009f1:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The Japanese replies that the attack will not land; rendering the repeated verb as drinking breaks the exchange.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":37,"text":"driiink"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000a54:text","row":40409,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、ビート板使うの禁止！」","en":"“No fair using a kickboard!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01321","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00032","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00032"],"en":"Kiri: \"Ah, kickboard usage is forbidden!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01321","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000a54:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000aad:text","row":40410,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「楯だよー」","en":"“It's my shield!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01634","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00033","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00033"],"en":"Miki: \"It's my shield!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01634","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000aad:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000af4:text","row":40411,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずるー！」","en":"“Cheater!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00242","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00034","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00034"],"en":"Kiri: \"Cheeeat!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00242","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000af4:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000b3d:text","row":40412,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「髪の長さが違う分、ハンデいるもん」","en":"“Our hair's different lengths, so a handicap is only fair.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01294","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00035","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00035"],"en":"Miki: \"The length of my hear is different, so I gotta have a handicap!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01294","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000b3d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The English has 'hear' where the Japanese and sentence require 'hair.'","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":24,"text":"hear"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000b79:text","row":40413,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"なんだよそりゃ。","en":"What kind of logic was that?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01212","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00036","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00036"],"en":"What's even that mean.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01212","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000b79:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000ba1:text","row":40414,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"苦笑してしまう。","en":"I couldn't help smiling wryly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00659","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00037","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00037"],"en":"I end up with a strained smile.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00659","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000ba1:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000bec:text","row":40415,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「けど、片手になった分、攻撃力は下がってる！」","en":"“But that shield costs you one hand, so your attack power's down!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00278","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00038","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00038"],"en":"Kiri: \"But now that one of your hands got busy, your offensive abilities have decreased!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00278","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000bec:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000c57:text","row":40416,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"「しもうたー！」","en":"“Curses! I've blundered!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00795","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00039","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00039"],"en":"Miki: \"Daymn iiit!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00795","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000c57:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000ca2:text","row":40417,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「狩りの時間だー！」","en":"“The hunt begins!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01714","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00040","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00040"],"en":"Kiri: \"Time to hunt!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01714","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000ca2:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000cf3:text","row":40418,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「狩猟解禁！？」","en":"“Open season?!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00198","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00041","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00041"],"en":"Miki: \"They rescinded the hunting prohibition?!","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography"],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00198","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000cf3:text"],"continuationRefs":[]},"assessment":"The English dialogue opens a quotation but does not close it.","remedy":"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":0,"text":"Miki: \"They rescinded the hunting prohibition?!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000d1b:text","row":40419,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"ざぶざぶと動き回りながら、水をかけあう。","en":"They churned around the pool, splashing each other.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01951","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00042","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00042"],"en":"Splashing and splashing around they toss water onto each other.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01951","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000d1b:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000d5b:text","row":40420,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"無邪気なもんだ。","en":"Such innocent fun.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00681","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00043","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00043"],"en":"It's so innocent.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00681","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000d5b:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000d88:text","row":40421,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"トクン","en":"Thump.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00457","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00044","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00044"],"en":"Badump.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00457","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000d88:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000dae:text","row":40422,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「……！」","en":"“...!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02020","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00045","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00045"],"en":"Taichi: \"...!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02020","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000dae:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000dd0:text","row":40423,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"心臓が跳ねた。","en":"My heart leaped.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02356","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00046","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00046"],"en":"My physical heart took a leap.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:02356","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000dd0:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000df6:text","row":40424,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"軽く胸を打たれて。","en":"Something tapped lightly against my chest.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00819","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00047","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00047"],"en":"My chest was struck, lightly.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00819","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000df6:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000e20:text","row":40425,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"無意識に心臓を押さえた。","en":"Without thinking, I pressed a hand to my heart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01772","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00048","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00048"],"en":"Unconsciously I was pressing onto my heart.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01772","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000e20:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000e50:text","row":40426,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"臓器に心があるわけではない。","en":"Feelings didn't reside in the organ itself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00429","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00049","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00049"],"en":"But the heart, as in the spirit, is not inside my internal organs.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00429","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000e50:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000e84:text","row":40427,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"俺の感じたことが、心臓さえノックしてのけた。","en":"Even so, what I'd felt had gone so far as to knock on my actual heart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01539","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00050","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00050"],"en":"What I had felt gave a knock onto my physical heart.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01539","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000e84:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000ec8:text","row":40428,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"そのことが嬉しかった。","en":"That made me happy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01595","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00051","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00051"],"en":"I was happy it did.","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01595","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000ec8:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000f19:text","row":40429,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「きゃあっ！」","en":"“Aah!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905099","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00025","en":"Kiri: \"KyAaAh!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000f82:text","row":40430,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「あははははっ、転んだー！」","en":"“Hahahaha! You fell!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905100","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00026","en":"Miki: \"Ahahahahah, you feeell!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00000fd9:text","row":40431,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「ずぶぬれぇ……」","en":"“I'm soaked...”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01254","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00054","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00054"],"en":"Kiri: \"I'm soaked...\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01254","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00000fd9:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001028:text","row":40432,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「どんくさーい、にぶーい」","en":"“Clumsy! Slowpoke!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01120","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00055","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00055"],"en":"Miki: \"Sluuuggish, slooow!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01120","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00001028:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000107d:text","row":40433,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「……言ったなぁ」","en":"“...You asked for it.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00957","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00056","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00056"],"en":"Kiri: \"...now you said iiit.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00957","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000107d:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000010cc:text","row":40434,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"「おひょ？」","en":"“Uh-oh?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01346","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00057","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00057"],"en":"Miki: \"Oyoh?\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01346","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000010cc:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001113:text","row":40435,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"「濡れたらもう泳げるもんね」","en":"“Now that I’m wet, I might as well swim.”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00023","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00058","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00058"],"en":"Kiri: \"I'm all wet so I might as well swim.\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:00023","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00001113:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000116c:text","row":40436,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「あっ、あっあっ、接近戦はだめー！」","en":"“Ah, ah, ah—no close combat!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01683","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00059","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00059"],"en":"Miki: \"Ah, ah-ah, close quarters combat nooo!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01683","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000116c:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000011cb:text","row":40437,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「平泳ぎでクロールに勝てるもんかぁ！」","en":"“As if breaststroke could ever beat the crawl!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01002","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00060","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00060"],"en":"Kiri: \"You think you can beat crawl with breast stroke?!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01002","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000011cb:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000122e:text","row":40438,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「あたふたあたふたっ」","en":"“Panicking! Panicking!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01159","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00061","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00061"],"en":"Miki: \"Hurry-ingly-pani-icky!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01159","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000122e:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000127f:text","row":40439,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「水浸しにしてやるっ」","en":"“I’ll soak you!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905101","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00027","en":"Kiri: \"I'll plunge you down!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"Kiri threatens to soak or drench Miki with water. The English instead says she will force Miki downward.","remedy":"I'll soak you!","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":28,"start":7,"text":"I'll plunge you down!"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000012d2:text","row":40440,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"「だめー！　濡れたら髪がワカメになるー！」","en":"“No! If my hair gets wet, it'll turn into seaweed!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905102","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00028","en":"Miki: \"Nooo! If you wet my hear it'll turn into Wakame seaweed!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","presentation"],"assessment":"The English contains a typo that changes 'hair' to the verb 'hear.'","remedy":"my hair","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":31,"start":24,"text":"my hear"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001337:text","row":40441,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"「ワカメちゃんにしてやるー！」","en":"“Then I'll turn you into Seaweed Sally!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905103","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00029","en":"Kiri: \"I'll make you into Wakame-chan theeen!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001392:text","row":40442,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「わっ、わっ、まずっ」","en":"“W-wait, wait—this is bad!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01499","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00065","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00065"],"en":"Miki: \"Wah, wah, bad!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01499","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:00001392:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000013e3:text","row":40443,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「そらー！」","en":"“Take that!”","speakerJa":"霧","speakerEn":"Kiri","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01570","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00066","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00066"],"en":"Kiri: \"Soh'raaa!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01570","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:000013e3:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000142c:text","row":40444,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「ぎにゃーーーーーーー！！」","en":"“GNYAAAAAAAAAAAH!!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01576","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc0039:00067","unitIds":["ghs-tl:ccc0039:00067"],"en":"Miki: \"Myeeeeeeeeow!!!\"","verdict":"withheld","categories":[],"renderGroup":{"id":"ghs-public-alias-group:01576","shape":"1:1","sourceRefs":["ccfc:sn:0316:0000142c:text"],"continuationRefs":[]}}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001460:text","row":40445,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"弾ける水の音。","en":"Water burst with a crash.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905104","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00030","en":"Sounds of water bursts.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001486:text","row":40446,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"とめどない笑声。","en":"Their laughter went on and on.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905105","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00031","en":"Ceaseless laughter.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000014ae:text","row":40447,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"やんわりと流れる時間を思わせて、優しい。","en":"Gentle as time flowing softly by.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905106","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00032","en":"A gentleness that reminds of the soft flowing of hours.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000014ee:text","row":40448,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"優しい世界の一場面。","en":"A moment from a gentle world.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905107","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00033","en":"A scene from a gentle world.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000151a:text","row":40449,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"日記に書こうと思った。","en":"I decided to put it in the diary.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905108","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00034","en":"I thought I would write this in the diary,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001548:text","row":40450,"ordinal":73,"kind":"text","jp":"この気持ちを、忘れないよう。","en":"So I wouldn't forget how this felt.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905109","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00035","en":"so that I would never forget these emotions.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000157c:text","row":40451,"ordinal":74,"kind":"text","jp":"俺はずっと、二人の少女が戯れる様子を眺めていた。","en":"For a long time, I watched the two girls play.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905110","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00036","en":"And I, all throughout, gazed at these two girls lost in their playfulness.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000015c4:text","row":40452,"ordinal":75,"kind":"text","jp":"そして……彼女たちと打算的に交流しようとする行為が、途端にむなしく思えてきた。","en":"And suddenly, the idea of involving myself with them for some ulterior purpose felt hollow.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905111","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00037","en":"And then... I came to think that the act of calculating self-interested interaction with these girls would become instantaneously fruitless.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["tense_aspect","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The narrator says his calculating attempt to interact with the girls suddenly felt empty. The English recasts this as a prediction that the interaction will later become fruitless.","remedy":"suddenly seemed utterly empty","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":139,"start":101,"text":"would become instantaneously fruitless"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:00001632:text","row":40453,"ordinal":76,"kind":"text","jp":"「俺はただ……見たいだけなのに」","en":"“All I want... is to see it.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905112","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00038","en":"Taichi: \"Because I just... only want to see it.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["addition","presentation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:0000166a:text","row":40454,"ordinal":77,"kind":"text","jp":"当たり前のように、人のそばにあるものを。","en":"Something that should be there beside people as a matter of course.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905114","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00040","en":"that people who exist right next to each other, as if their presence were natural,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","grammar"],"assessment":"The Japanese names what ordinarily exists beside people as the object he wants to remember. The English turns it into an unfinished relative clause about nearby people.","remedy":"the things that are naturally there beside people;","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":82,"start":0,"text":"that people who exist right next to each other, as if their presence were natural,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000016aa:text","row":40455,"ordinal":78,"kind":"text","jp":"人を心地よくさせるふれあいを。","en":"The warmth of human contact.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:905115","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020c:00041","en":"will have with others an exchange of touches that is pleasant for their heart.","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice","grammar"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0316:000016e0:text","row":40456,"ordinal":79,"kind":"text","jp":"記憶にとどめたいだけなのに。","en":"All I wanted was to hold it in my memory.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[]}]}
